      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stepping out of the frame\"... that's a heavy way to put it. you make it sound almost peaceful. like there's a certain dignity in just not being part of the wreckage anymore. you really think there's more grace in leaving early than in just sticking it out until the very end?",
